window.products.push({"id":335064,"name":"SUNWUKIN 304 Stainless Steel Fine Mesh Strainers for Kitchen, Colander-Skimmer with Handle, Sieve Sifters for Food, Tea, Rice, Oil, Noodles, Fruits, V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xajaAPM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Noodle Strainer The small holes would prevent food from falling through, while drain water quickly. It's easy to use this fine mesh strainer to take noodles or vermicelli out of hot water.  Flour & Sugar powder Strainer Using this strainer, you can easily spread flour on cake or sugar powder on doughnuts, which makes sieving and refining a breeze.  Skimmer The strainer can be used as skimmer, great for refining juice, butter, condensed milk or sauce.  Fine Mesh Makes Sifting & Draining Easy This strainer has a fine-grid mesh for draining the excess liquid from just about any food. The mesh is fine enough to strain rice, quinoa and beans, water drains quickly and the item would not fall through. This strainer set is also perfect for sifting flour, cocoa and powdered sugar as well as separating eggs when you are baking food. It can be used as cocktail double strainer, baking sifter, coffee dripper.  Easy to Use With a Well-Made Construction The mesh is completely affixed to the reinforced rim and not able to pull out of the rim, making them more substantial. There is no problem with food getting stuck between the steel mesh and the rims. Each strainer comes with a metal loop at the top for hanging from a wall- hook, while making it easy to set onto a bowl/ cup/ pot, which keeps it level and prevents it from falling-in.  Easy to Clean & Dishwasher Safe It's also easy to clean it by hand washing. Wash with a mild detergent, rinse off and dry.   Fine Mesh Strainers Set Much better than regular steel or plastic that can break or rust. 304 Stainless steel is the material of choice for homes and commercial kitchens.   Many Uses for Cooking & Food Preparation","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xajaAPM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunwukin","source_asin":"B0BTYJG1VB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTYJG1VB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTYJG1VB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
