window.products.push({"id":335279,"name":"NORTH HOME 100% Cotton Duvet Cover Queen Size, Ultra Soft 400 Thread Count Long Staple Cotton Queen Duvet Cover, Luxury Sateen Weave 3 Piece Bedding S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mIUCj937L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOFT & BREATHABLE DUVER COVER SET: Our 400 thread count comforter cover set is made of 100% and long-staple cotton that is sweat wicking and gives the skin sufficient space to breathe. The quilt cover set applies a sateen weave process that creates exceptional softness to give you beauty sleep all night long. SIMPLE DESIGN: Our duvet cover is designed for everyday use yet it gives a feel of luxury hotel bedding. Available in a wide range of vibrant colors match any decor and make the ultimate gift idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas. Best for any room in your house - bedroom, guest, kids room, vacation home WHAT YOU CAN GET: Available in NORTH HOME duvet cover set queen size, 1 duvet cover 90\" x 92\", 2 pillow cases 20\"x26\". We choose buttons closure for an elegant look aims more durable than zipper closure. Our fabulous selection of vibrant colors won’t fade after washing and are a beautiful, elegant way to update your bedroom. CERTIFIED STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX: All duvet cover are STANDARD 100 by OEKO‐TEX. According to the guidelines, these products are tested and produced in socially responsible manner. Each fabric batch is also tested for various durability features such as no-pilling, low shrinkage, color fastness etc, then stitched, individually inspected and finally packed for sales EASY CARE: Machine wash separately in cold water, gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Tumble dry on low heat or lay flat to dry. Remove promptly. Warm iron as needed. No pilling, no shrink, no fade.If you prefer wrinkle less bedding, no worries. Just use short dry cycle and pull your duvet cover from the dryer right when it ends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mIUCj937L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NORTH HOME","source_asin":"B08SBX7T3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SBX7T3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SBX7T3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
