window.products.push({"id":335326,"name":"Giantex Over-The-Toilet Storage Rack, Bathroom Freestanding Space Saver with 1-Door Side Storage Cabinet, 2 Open Adjustable Shelves, Anti-Topping Desi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CJWuPc0NL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"○√Anti-Toppling Design: For your safety concern, this over-toilet-space-saver has a toppling preventer that could be mounted to the wall. Overall dimension: 30\" x 8\" x 41.5\", Weight capacity of top shelf: 44 lbs, Weight capacity of adjustable shelf: 11 lbs. ○√Convenient Adjustable Shelves: The toilet rack owns two adjustable shelves and has three height levels to choose from. In this way, you could adjust the shelf to the height you need based on the size of the object you are placing, which could facilitate space arrangement. ○√Space Saving Design: This bathroom storage rack includes two open shelves, one holder, and one side cabinet with an adjustable shelf, which could provide a large amount of storage space for the placement of sanitary supplies and sundries. What’s more, the slim shape occupies a little floor space while saving plenty of bathroom space. ○√Sturdy & Solid Structure: We adopt exquisite craftsmanship and P2 grade MDF material structure with screw reinforcement that ensures the stability and durability of this toilet cabinet. At the same time, the whole cabinet enjoys high toughness and is not easy to scratch or deform. ○√Concise and Elegant Appearance: As functional bathroom furniture, this toilet space saver has a contemporary design and great appearance to decorate your bathroom. The curved top design, white finish, and side cabinet could perfectly blend in various decoration styles and leave your guests with a deep impression.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CJWuPc0NL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B084SVNGYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084SVNGYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084SVNGYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":335327,"name":"Raise Products Paper Napkin Bands Self Adhesive | Paper Napkin Rings Self-Adhering | Pre-Cut | Disposable | Safety Glue | Bond Paper | Pack of 500, 4.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31U37PwWRUL._AC_.jpg","description":"STYLE Disposable doesn’t mean you have to sacrifice the looks of your napkin bands. Our bands come in all colors and can be used in any environment you put them in. These bands are specifically made for Cloth Napkins at Birthday Parties or Family Functions. Style may be an important factor in setting the right tone at your party or event. Our bands incorporate only solid colors which make them extremely easy to do exactly what you want with them, whether you need them to stand out or blend right in with the rest of your supplies. PRACTICAL We have made sure that our bands can function to fit any party or get together that you are planning. They come with a self-sealing glue to help ensure that your utensils won’t go anywhere until they are opened. We know that nobody wants napkin bands that will open easy, and make your table look unprofessional or unprepared. These bands have a strong bond which will seal your cutlery from dirt and dust to make sure that when you open them, your utensils are exactly the way you put them in. VERSATILE Do you think that you need a special napkin band for your event? When we started developing our napkin bands, this question hit us. This is why our napkin bands are suitable for all events such as: weddings, birthday parties, catering events, or even at your restaurant. Nobody wants to buy different bands for different events and you don’t have to. These bands also store effortlessly with their flat structure in the box, so you don’t need to take up more space than expected. ONE COMPANY, ENDLESS OPTIONS With two different sizes and almost unlimited color choices, they can handle anything that is thrown their way. There is no need to choose napkin bands that are just going to get the job done anymore when we have every option you could think of to offer. For your next event, make sure to set the mood right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31U37PwWRUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Raise Products","source_asin":"B083G6R7BG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083G6R7BG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083G6R7BG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
