window.products.push({"id":335352,"name":"Leopard Cheetah 4pcs Shower Curtain Set - Waterproof African Bathroom Decor Accessories (1 Animal Print Curtain & 3 Rugs) - Easy Install w/12 Grommets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vFJ1ZkCkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AFRICAN LEOPARD PRINT DESIGN - Give your bathroom the facelift it deserves with our Alabohuke 3D high-definition leopard print shower curtain and mats. This set will eliminate the dullness and boredom of your bathroom and make it come alive. The design blends in well with your decor without missing a beat. 4-IN-1 COMBO - Our package includes a 70.8x70.8inch leopard print shower curtain, 29.5x 17.7inch bathroom rug, 17.7x 14.7inch U-shape rug, and 15× 16.5inch toilet lid cover to help you adorn your bathroom to your specification. The size of these Afrocentric bathroom decor items makes them a universal fit for most bathroom sizes. HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL - This Alabohuke shower curtain and bathroom rugs combo consists of items made from high-quality material that will serve you for long without fading. The shower curtain features premium quality flannel material that is soft and slip-resistant. The rugs are made from polyester, which gives them the waterproof and non-skid qualities that make them stand out. ENHANCE YOUR PRIVACY - Our large 70.8x70.8inch (180x180cm) 3D leopard print shower curtain comes with 12 high-quality grommets and 12 hooks for easy mounting, thus giving your privacy when taking a shower. The grommets and hooks are made from high-quality rust-proof material that ensures they look brand new even after extended use. EASY MAINTENANCE - The waterproof quality of our Alabohuke shower curtain and the rugs in the package works well to prevent dampness in your bathroom. Additionally, the set is easy to wash by hand or machine, ensuring you can keep them clean easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vFJ1ZkCkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Douup","source_asin":"B08K4NC58B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K4NC58B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K4NC58B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
