window.products.push({"id":335355,"name":"H&MAI Welcome Sign for Front Door, 12'' Front Door Sign for Farmhouse, 3D Welcome Door Sign, Round Wood Hanging Welcome Sign Housewarming €‹Gift for H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aIA09qCBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose Our Welcome Sign front door decor? H&MAI Committed to creating home decorations that can bring joys to you, your family and friends. Our  welcome Sign is the most beautiful and most decorative Welcome Sign produced through continuous improvement.H&MAI's quality made round sign is the perfect way to welcome your family, friends and neighbors to your beautiful home.Decorate your home with rustic feel, create a good first impression to your family and friend!. ✅ Premium Material -- Welcome sign for front door is made of high-quality wood, durable and not easy to fade. ✅ Realistic Green Plants -- High quality handmade grey green leaves with delicate flowers, make ours front door decor looks tender and dainty，used the best glue on the sign to make it sturdy and durable! ✅ Nice-looking 3D Lettering -- With 3D effect,hand cut in a classical script,making this door decor a high-end artwork ✅ Perfect for anywhere -- Front door, front porch, wall, ect. Specifiction: Color: Black Material: High-quality wood Dimensions: 12 inch Packing list: (1)1 x Welcome Sign. (2)2 x sticky hooks（black  hook and transparent hook） Warm Tip: Mounting: it can be Hang on anywhere, also can be placed at tabletop or shelf. Transportation: The leaves may be squeezed during transportation, it can be re-adjusted to the shape you want, no worries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aIA09qCBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H&MAI","source_asin":"B09CV7CKFX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CV7CKFX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CV7CKFX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":335356,"name":"Northwest Art Mall Moosehead Lake Greenville Maine Moose Painting by Paul A Lanquist, 11-Inch by 17-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.76,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WQ6QHec5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Paul A. Lanquist is a northwest artist who currently lives near mt. St. Helens washington with his wife and family. Paul is a dedicated outdoor enthusiast, has been a commercial artist and illustrator for 20 years and has worked for a variety of companies such as fred meyer, danner boots, gi joe's, whole foods, luhr jensen, and princess cruise lines. His unique style captures the rugged, quaint, friendly and dignified personality of life in united states and canada. Paul believes that part of being a good illustrator is learning to build from past experience and to study the work of other american illustrators. Through the years paul has gravitated to the work of illustrators from the 20's, 30's, and 40's that use color and design to communicate their ideas in a straightforward way. The natural beauty of america is another important influence in paul's work. by combining the nostalgic look and feel of the past with the spectacular scenery of this country, paul has created destination and travel items that capture the beauty and lifestyle found there.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WQ6QHec5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art of Place","source_asin":"B007R0QTCE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007R0QTCE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007R0QTCE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
