window.products.push({"id":335374,"name":"HBlife Luxury Soft Faux Fur Blanket Twin Size 60X80 Inches, Elegant Fuzzy Plush Fluffy Cozy Blankets for Sofa and Bed, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M-At5JhqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dual-Sided Design - The HBlife luxury warm faux fur throw blanket is made of 100% polyester microfiber fabric. Oftentimes, faux fur blankets are rough on one side but soft on the other side. HBlife's throw blanket solved that problem. The double-sided design offers you the same sense of ultra-softness and provides you luxurious comfort and style. Exquisite Sewing & Decorative - Luxury runs through every stitch, seam, and thread of the HBlife plush blanket. Add extra texture to your decor and turns your room into an inviting space with this simple yet classy elegant design; drape it over a chair, couch, or bed to add an exotic stylish touch to your living room or bedroom, many available colors allow for easy mixing and matching with your decor or other accent pieces. Lightweight & Great Gift - The HBlife fuzzy blanket feels like you are wrapped in furry heaven. It's breathable and has a perfect weight. Which makes it easy to bring along on a road trip/airplane flight. HBlife blanket is designed for a thoughtful caring personal gift to loved ones. The intent of this blanket is not only to bring warmth but also to bring smiles, joy, and a feeling of love. Versatile Usage - Snuggling on your couch and bed with the HBlife fuzzy blanket to enjoy your family's happy hours while watching favorite TV shows. Since the perfect weight, Which makes it easy to bring along on a road trip/airplane flight. Being able to take beautiful pictures on your social software as a photography prop, your pets will like the soft feeling of a long hair blanket as well. It's also an ideal choice for all seasons! Care-Free Wash - The HBlife faux fur plush blanket was created with ease of care in mind. Using cold water and your machine's gentle cycle, you can keep your throw blanket fresh and clean for years. Dries on no heat or extra low heat. Cuddle up and enjoy the HBlife blanket!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M-At5JhqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HBlife","source_asin":"B097RLD2R8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097RLD2R8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097RLD2R8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
