window.products.push({"id":335502,"name":"MBXHDBD Mini Organic Diatomite Handmade Compact Couple Toothbrush Holder Stand Fast Drying for Bathroom Vanity Countertops(Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71axfoj9G3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"feature:A high-quality toothbrush holder made entirely by hand.Diatomite products, keep the toothbrush clean and dry, have strong water absorption.Easy to clean, simply use water and brush. Unique and fresh marble color, beautiful art.Multifunctional compact storage device. (Toothbrush, pen, lipstick, razor).Simple and compact, more convenient storage. The design is simple and suitable for all kinds of bathrooms.note:1. When unpacking, there will be a small amount of powder on the surface of the product, which is caused by the hand-made process and is very normal.2. This product is fragile, please handle with care.3. If the surface is dirty, please do not use soap cleaners to clean it, otherwise it may reduce the absorption capacity. Simply use clean water.4. If the water absorption performance is reduced, please wash it with warm water and put it in a place that is not exposed to direct sunlight to dry. It can be restored after drying in the shade. Do not expose to direct sunlight during this period, otherwise the product may bend or crack.5. If bending occurs, it can be restored after being overcast in a ventilated place.specification:Model: Toothbrush holderMaterial: diatomite+clay+marbleColor: blue, pink, green, whiteFunction: toothbrush storageSize: 2.2 inches x 1.8 inches x 1.8 inchesWeight: 4.8 ouncesAbout MBXHDBD:MBXHDBD We have always been committed to household products, bringing a fresh and lively atmosphere to your home and office.Designers have created simple and smooth lines, shapes, and integrated art into people's daily life through the display of artifacts, so that people that lives in busy modern society can return to nature and feel the beauty and tranquility of life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71axfoj9G3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MBXHDBD","source_asin":"B08QRM719Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QRM719Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QRM719Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
