window.products.push({"id":335542,"name":"POLYTE Oversize, 60 x 30 in, Quick Dry Lint Free Microfiber Bath Towel Set, 6 Piece (Blue, Waffle Weave)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SL+JEdW5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If we may, would you care for some blissful bath towels? We created them just for you, so you can experience a SPA-LIKE quality in your own home--with a COZY and SUPER SOFT feeling on the skin without the heft and bulk. They are infused with SUPER ABSORBENT properties to effectively dry your body and hair. Washcloths are infused with GENTLE EXFOLIATING properties to effectively remove dead skin cells--simply dampen with water. SUPERIOR LATHER with bar soaps or body washes. Towels, themselves, DRY QUICKLY to RESIST ODORS.Allow us to share how to EASILY CARE for these blissful towels. Recommend washing separately to prevent collecting lint or debris from other garments and textiles. Please hand or machine wash in warm water with like colors and air dry or dry on the low setting. Recommend using wool dryer balls to reduce any static when drying. We ask you not use fabric softener, bleach, dryer sheets or the towels may become less blissful. Can also launder in a laundry bag to keep separated from mixed loads and away from debris.Recommend using towels to pat dry your body and not wipe dry. Key Product Features Size Large: bath towel - 30 inches by 60 inches or 76.2 cm by 152 cm, hand towel - 16 inches by 30 inches or 40.64 cm by 76.2 cm, washcloth - 13 inches by 13 inches or 33 cm by 33 cm Weave: waffle weave Edges/Trim: satin with rounded corners Includes: 2 bath towels, 2 hand towels, 2 washcloths Classification: DeluxePolyte Microfiber Classifications:Standard <300 gsmPremium = 300 - 349 gsmProfessional = 350 - 399 gsmDeluxe > 399 gsm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SL+JEdW5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POLYTE","source_asin":"B0B3D42GVJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3D42GVJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3D42GVJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
