window.products.push({"id":335583,"name":"Jolette Designs Firefighter Christmas Ornament, Fireman Wooden Tree Decor Gifts for Fire Fighter, EMT, Men, Women, Graduation. 3.25X3.25 Inspiring Xma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513qcCYg2wL._AC_.jpg","description":"Show Your Support To Fire Fighting Heroes!Are you in search of a quality-crafted hanging ornament dedicated to the honorable Fire Department?How about an inspiring firefighter ornament for your room wall decoration, the Christmas tree décor?Get Your Hands On A Uniquely Eye-Catching Wooden Firefighter Ornament, Released by Jolette Designs!We have created an original design firefighter ornament, made of genuine red alder wood, precision laser cut, with a clear lacquer finish on the one side and the back unfinished, for you to add your personalized engraving.With the “Firefighter” engraving on top, the motivational logo in the center and the “Courage- Honor-Valor” inscription at the bottom, this ornament is a one-of-a-kind symbol of the fire department.Create The Most Original Decoration!Hanging from a vibrant red, blue and white hanger cord, our ornament is ready to hang on your man cave wall, on your car mirror or on your Christmas tree, to create unique Christmas ambience.Offer The Best Gift!Treat a loved firefighter to a novelty Christmas, birthday, Father's day, Mother's day, graduation, retirement or wedding gift! What Makes Our Firefighter Ornament So Special?✔ Natural Red Alder Wood – Sturdy And Long-Lasting✔ One Side Coated With Clear Lacquer Finish – Polished And Elegant✔ Unfinished Wooden Back –Personalize Your Ornament!✔ Precision Laser Cut Design – Made By Skilled American Craftsmen✔ Perfect Size Of 3 ¼” Diameter – Ideal Christmas Tree, Wall, Car Mirror Decor✔ Colorful Blue, Red And White Hanging Cord – Stylish, In The National USA ColorsDon’t Waste Another Minute!Click Add To Cart NOW & Get This Fantastic Firefighter Ornament Risk-Free!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513qcCYg2wL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jolette Designs","source_asin":"B0B8YCNBT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8YCNBT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8YCNBT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":335584,"name":"90L Clothes Storage Bag Organizer, 4Pack Large Foldable Comforter Clothing Blanket Storage Bags Containers with Clear Window Zippers Handles Sheet Clo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eGp1FIVbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Material: The clothes storage bags are made from high-quality, odorless and three-ply composite non-woven fabric, helping promote ventilation and protect your stored items from dust and moisture. The stainless steel zipper of clothes storage organizer is equipped with two-way #5 stainless steel zippers that may pull together not easily broken, ensuring a long service life for the storage bags with lids. Large Capacity: Each blanket storage bags clothes organizer measures 23.6 x 16.9 x 13.8 in / 60 x 43 x 35 cm, with 90L capacity. The storage bags for clothes is spacious to store your comforters, pillows, bedding, blankets, plush toys, sweaters, out of season clothing or any other soft items to keep them fresh and clean. This comforter storage bags can keep items organized while ensuring that they are free of dust and dirt. Reinforced Handle: The handle of our clothing storage bags is sewn with two layers of thick fabric, and the load-bearing capacity is doubled. Reinforced seams are also implemented for added strength. when you move or load heavy items, these sheet blanket organizers and storage are hard to be broken and can be used for a longer period of time. The comforter blanket bag is easy to pack/unpack when traveling and moving or as needed. Multifunctional & Foldable: Foldable closet storage organizer, These storage containers for clothes can be easily folded flat and put away when not in use. The set can be used in the wardrobe closet or under the bed. Suitable for home, living room,closets, dorms, attics, shelves, basements, bedrooms, etc. It helps to free up space and keep all items organized and tidy. This clothes storage containers is nice for your college dorm room or anywhere else with little closet space to save space. Easy to Store and Take: The bedding storage bags with zipper can be fully opened, making storage more convenient. And two-way zippers allow clothes storage organizer to easily slide along the closure when in use, regardless of how full the clothing storage bag is. The linen bedding quilt storage even has small handles on the front so it’s easily pulling them when need them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eGp1FIVbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Besslly","source_asin":"B0BRQ1RJL3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRQ1RJL3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRQ1RJL3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
