window.products.push({"id":335658,"name":"Viking Traders Original Viking Drinking Horn Mug with Burlap Sack - 20 Oz Wood Base Extra Large Medieval Inspired Handcrafted Cup polished Natural & R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t-R0VM-GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Viking Traders as the name says wants to present you with memorabilia from past and what better way then enjoying the feast of Winter Nights or Jul like a true Viking with a Horn Ale Mug. Our original Viking horn mug is coated with 100% Food safe non-toxic lacquer from inside, in order to avoid the real horn odor and to avoid leakage Each of our Viking drink horn tankards is made by hand, Each one of our horn mugs is 100% unique in color and shape and features no two alike! This means your purchase will grant you a Horn Tankard of your own and take pride in one of a kind art piece! traditionally hand crafted from authentic, ethically sourced ox horn. You can now enjoy the authentic design, giant mug and feeling of drinking beer like a proper Viking! These hand crafted unique pieces of art range from 6-7inches Made from a solid piece of horn for 20 oz of your preferred drink, it will feel just right in your hands and we GUARANTEE you won’t go back to drinking beer any other way. Viking Trader's beautiful Viking drink horn cups come complete with an authentic Medieval style. This makes it a perfect and unique gifting opportunity for lover of the medieval Viking ages in your life who likes to drink beer like a true Viking. It would certainly be a unique, awesome and a quite unexpected gift. Excellent hand crafted Original hand crafted Viking horn mug/tunkard for men and women to be used and gifted for seasonal feasts such as Winter Nights, Jul, Mabon, a wedding or a celebration of a successful raiding voyage, medieval renaissance costumes and events, can be practically applied as a functional set of utensils or as a display piece in any medieval or historical collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t-R0VM-GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viking Traders","source_asin":"B09JHWGP7P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JHWGP7P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JHWGP7P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
