window.products.push({"id":335814,"name":"Moxeay Fabric Dining Chair Set of 2 Upholstered Accent Dining Chairs Wood Tufted Dining Chairs for Living Room,Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":195.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717VbQU4dKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Note :To ensure proper assembly, please follow all steps provided in the User Manual (provided in pdf below).Please open the black woven fabric with Velcro closure on the bottom of the frame then removing the parts for assembly Fabric Parson Dining Chairs:This is a classic modern style fabric dining chairs. It's quite sturdy and nice looking.The back of the chair is high back design and the upholstered soft seat can provide full support for your hip, which contains high quality foam to keep the seat in a fixed shape and good resilience instead of deforming after long time seating.The capalicy can up to 250lbs Stabilize High Back Chair:Made of solid wood, the outward-curved legs also improve chair's stability and safety.The footpad of the chair is non-slip and wear-resistant, well protect your floor from being scratched, and keep quiet when moving.The slightly curved high backrest with roll-back top is ergonomically designed to fit your body shape, protecting your waists and back Versatile Wingeback Chairs:The button-tufted backrest and the handcrafted decorative nailhead trim, this piece adds an eye-catching color to your look, and the linen fabric gives you the ultimate in comfort. A vintage modern addition to the dining room, living space, office, or entryway, this chair complements decor styles including modern, traditional, contemporary, and farmhouse Dimentions: The overall size for this chair is 24.2D\"*18.8\"W*39\"H, the seat depth is 16\"D, seat width: 24.2 W\", seat height: 20\"H,back height: 19\"H Multifunctional Accent Chair: This chair was sold in sets of 2, these modern chairs are very functional and can be paired perfectly with a coffee table in the kitchen or a fireplace in the living room.Elegant and high-end dining chairs fit into any home style, traditional or modern, minimal or luxurious Easy Assembly:This dining chair is very easy to assemble, and all the hardware are included, no extra tools needed.It could be assembled in 10-15 minutes by reading the instructions.This dining chair is ideal for families, restaurants,kitchens and companies,etc.It could add more elegance to your dining space Please Note:This package will comes with 2 pieces dining chairs in one box. If any parts are missing or damaged after you receive the package, please feel free to contact us, we will reply you within 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717VbQU4dKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moxeay","source_asin":"B08CRCQ35Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335814","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CRCQ35Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CRCQ35Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
