window.products.push({"id":335821,"name":"NEVAEHEART Patchouli Reed Diffuser Oil Refill and Sticks Set | Includes a Free Set of Reed Sticks | Rich Patchouli, Bergamot & Guaiac Wood Fragrance N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YgzQBeb-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IMPRESSION OF SCENT - Patchouli fragrance can help you reduce tension and pressure, thus achieving happiness and easiness. It is also your psychological counselor's \"secret weapon\". Made with 100% pure essential oil, safe and toxic-free! Our fragrances are free from formaldehyde, methanol, benzene, glyoxal and dichloroethylene. LONG-LASTING SCENTS - Large capacity of 6.8 oz, fragrant for more than 120 days! Extend the life of your favorite scented reed diffusers with our convenient and easy-to-use refill oil. Nevaeheart reed diffuser refill oil continuously delivers a long-lasting, true-to-life scent gently throughout its surroundings. REPLACEMENT REEDS INCLUDED - The fragrance oil refill comes in a large-capacity 6.8 oz & resealable bottle, so you may use what you need and save the rest for later. Includes an extra set of reeds to optimize performance throughout the life of the diffuser. Replace the first set of reeds when the diffusion rate slows down. EASY TO USE - Simply refill your Nevaeheart glass diffuser bottle and place reeds (included) in the diffuser bottle. Reeds absorb the scented oil, draw it to the top and diffuse it into the air. Our oil refills are the perfect way to refill an existing diffuser or create a dramatic diffuser accessory of your own. TO DEAR CUSTOMER - We all have our own perception of scent even bathing in the same fragrance. Please don’t hesitate to contact us if you don’t like the choice under your nose. We promise every customer a satisfying shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YgzQBeb-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEVAEHEART","source_asin":"B094XRSBTV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094XRSBTV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094XRSBTV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":335822,"name":"HLC.ME Serenity Floral 100% Complete Blackout Thermal Insulated Energy Savings Heat/Cold Blocking Floor Length Grommet Curtain Drapery Panels for Bedr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+qN+R9ZZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking to add a dash of elegance to your living spaces while improving comfort? With these extreme Blackout Curtains from HLC.ME, the beauty is much more than skin deep. Beyond the stunning design and array of fashionable colors, our thermal, insulated curtain panels block out disruptive light and help maintain a comfortable temperature in your home. Light blocking Thermal insulated for heat / cool air retention Premium, Thermal Bond Fabric Beautiful, no-fade jacquard floral design Sturdy metal grommets (not plastic) Wide array of colors and sizes available For indoor use only Studies show that light from outside can be detrimental to our sleep and the thin, sheer curtains that are highly popular today aren't much help. These Serenity Blackout Curtains from HLC.ME allow you to infuse your home with supreme style while creating a sleep sanctuary in your master bedroom, child's bedroom, or nursery. The secret of our curtain panels is our innovative thermal bond material, which effectively blocks light from shining through (100 Percent of light, in fact). Our blackout curtains are sturdy without being too heavy and bulky and provide a high-end decorative touch. Feel like warm or cool air just goes right out the window (along with your hard-earned money)? HLC.ME Blackout Curtains are the ideal complement to your efforts to conserve energy at home. Each panel features a thin thermal lining woven together into one layer to prevent heat and cold air from entering your home, keeping your living spaces at a comfortable temperature all year long. Machine washable: Dust build-up or stains on your curtains? No need to fret; simply toss the panels into the washing machine on the cold, delicate cycle and use a mild detergent (no bleach). You can even dry them in the dryer on a low setting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+qN+R9ZZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HLC.ME","source_asin":"B08FF97NQT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FF97NQT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FF97NQT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
