window.products.push({"id":335838,"name":"Clean 'n Brew - The Most Effective and All-Natural Cleaning and Descaling Cups Compatible with Keurig 2.0 machines - Removes Stains, Non-Toxic, No Har","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sypFoFx7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HYGIENIC CLEANING – Over time, oils, residue and moisture collect in your single-serve brewer which can result in mold and bacteria, as well as impact taste. Clean ‘n Brew is an all-natural, easy-to-use and effective cleaning and descaling cup that helps eliminate these things and restore your machine so it’s hygienically clean and ready to use whenever you want it. NATURAL, SAFE & NON-TOXIC – Clean ‘n Brew is the first all-natural cleaning and descaling cup on the market. The product contains no chemicals, harnessing the descaling power of natural citric acid and vinegar to help leave your single-serve brewer clean and with no chemical aftertaste. Even the cleaning cup itself is recyclable and it’s made in the USA. IMPROVE THE TASTE OF YOUR BREW – A build-up of oils and residues can quickly impact the flavor of your favorite beverage. Clean 'n Brew’s patented, all-natural cleaning cup cuts through these oils and residues so the next beverage you brew tastes as good as your first one. EXTEND THE LIFE OF YOUR MACHINE – Oils and residues build-up in the chamber of your single-serve brewer which can negatively impact the performance of your machine. By using Clean ‘n Brew’s all-natural cleaning cups to regularly clean and descale your single-serve brewer, you can help restore and extend the life of your machine in the same amount of time it takes to brew a cup of coffee. FANTASTIC VALUE – Each pack comes with five all-natural cleaning cups, ready-to-use, with simple instructions. Each cup provides superior cleaning power to help you clean your single-serve brewer so you can continue enjoying great tasting beverages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sypFoFx7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clean 'n Brew","source_asin":"B07W7L1X9M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W7L1X9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W7L1X9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
