window.products.push({"id":335881,"name":"All-Clad LTD 1-Quart Saucier Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31BQ823D16L._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Distinguished among All-Clad's renowned cookware collections by its stylish, charcoal-black, hard-anodized aluminum exterior, the LTD line provides serious and professional cooks all the virtues that make All-Clad's worldwide reputation unsurpassed. Key to its high performance is a three-ply, bonded construction. Sandwiched between the hard-anodized aluminum exterior and an 18/10 stainless-steel interior is a thick core of pure aluminum that spreads heat evenly across the bottoms of pots and pans and all the way up the sides. The interior is highly polished, so it's stick- as well as corrosion-resistant. The striking exterior resists scratching, chipping, and peeling. This classic, versatile 1-quart saucier has rounded sides, which increase the amount of food it can hold relative to the diameter of its bottom. Because the aluminum core extends up the sides, foods cook uniformly in the pan, even though it's 2-1/4 inches deep. And because the interior is nonreactive, tomato-based sauces and other acidic foods won't taste metallic. Its polished 18/10 stainless-steel handle is riveted to the pan for strength, grooved on the top and rounded on the bottom for comfort, and holed in the end for hanging on hook or peg. The long handle stays cool on the stovetop but won't be harmed by an oven's heat. LTD cookware carries a lifetime warranty against defects and should be hand washed. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31BQ823D16L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B00005AL8V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005AL8V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005AL8V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":335882,"name":"EZSipper Stainless Steel Straws - Reusable Straws | 304 Stainless Steel Straw for Drinking | Easy to Wash Metal Drinking Straws | 3-piece Metal Straw ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YjzBrkqKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ECO-FRIENDLY REUSABLE METAL STRAW - Don't let plastic continue ruining our earth. With our stainless straws, you can enjoy your favorite drinks without feeling guilty of your eco-footprint. Unlike disposable silicone, plastic, and paper straws, our steel straws drinking are made of thick stainless steel, so they will never break down or wear out. Add a fun, sustainable and stylish touch to any drink with the EZSipper collapsible metal straw. METAL REUSABLE STRAWS WITH CLEANER BRUSH - Our reuse straws come with a brush, so you can clean the inside of the stainless straw quickly and easily. The metal straw cleaner is small in size so it can slot straight into the steel straw for the best possible clean. After washing, store the collapsible straw inside the strainer tube. Water will pass through the strainer and then gather in the base cap. Disassemble all parts of the dishwasher safe straws before washing it with mild detergent. EASY TO ASSEMBLE METAL STRAW WITH CASE - Our tumbler straws reusable consist of 3 mini straws pieces and 2 tips that easily screw together and fit into a pocket-sized case, so you can take it anywhere and sip on the go. To put the long straw together, open the reusable straw case, screw the 3 pieces together and attach 1 of the straw tips. Then, drop the long metal straw into your glass or bottle and enjoy. Our drink straws are 6mm in diameter so it can hold 10oz (300ml) to 17oz (500ml). STURDY STAINLESS STEEL REUSABLE STRAWS - Made of top food-grade 304 stainless steel, our metal large straws and drinking straws reusable are almost unbreakable. Not only are they dishwasher and fridge-safe, our extra long reusable straws also feature a stainless-steel construction that's BPA-free, PVC-free, and phthalate-free so it won't leach bad stuff into your beverage or taste metallic as you drink. Our metal smoothie straws also come with a safe tip, which protects teeth, gums, and lips. UNIVERSAL FIT THICK REUSABLE STRAWS WITH CASE - At just 240mm (9.4 inch), this metallic straw is made to fit all bottles, tumblers, wine and cocktail glasses, and tea cups. Our tumbler straws have 3 different pieces which can be disassembled to fit any size cup or bottle. Long milkshake cups, small glasses, it doesn't matter – slip our portable straw reusable into your pocket and sip sustainably everywhere you go. Enjoy the natural taste of your favorite drinks with reusable drinking straws.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YjzBrkqKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EZSipper","source_asin":"B0827SHSPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0827SHSPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0827SHSPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
