window.products.push({"id":335917,"name":"Kitchen Details Fun Colors 2 Pack Counter-Safe Non-Stick Nylon Serving Spoon and Non-Stick Nylon Slotted Spoon with Silicone Grip Handle, Heat Resista","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NYx525FZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPOONS are almost as important - and as common - in the kitchen as heat is. So it's wise to choose spoons well and to know how and when to use them. For instance, a large slotted or perforated spoon is almost a necessity in making poached eggs (a preparation that, for some reason, stymies many cooks). Try that with any other kind of spoon and an egg is likely to prove an elusive catch. This same spoon is just what you need for tasting beef in a stew and removing vegetables from simmering water. It, like the spoons without slots, ought to feel comfortable in your hand and should be sturdy. The Solution? The Kitchen Details Fun Colors Counter-Safe Non-Stick Nylon Slotted Spoon. It is strong and well balanced not like the flimsy competitors (who will not be named). The Silicone Grip not only does it have non slip features but it also is heat resistant and as with all kitchen Details products, BPA Free. What truly sets this slotted spoon above the rest is its Clean Resting Technology the tip of your spoon won't touch your counter keeping your kitchen easy to clean and minimize drip and no more spoons rolling off the counter. Not to mention dishwasher safe. No need to worry about scraping your non stick coating off your pans since our spoon is made of durable nylon coated in soft silicone. Our mission is to bring you nothing short of perfection, to pass our passion and love from our kitchen to you and yours. Because we know how your heart goes into a dish and nothing but fun, easy to use kitchen tools will do.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NYx525FZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kennedy-Home","source_asin":"B083MB5VTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083MB5VTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083MB5VTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":335918,"name":"LaMont Home Set Lanai Coverlet, King, Taupe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ogU5-k+5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a modern look to your bedroom with this LaMont Home Lanai Matelasse Bedding Coverlet Set. This is a bedspread with timeless tradition. The all-over cane design adds a subtle tropical feel to the finished product. The LaMont home Lanai coverlet set includes the coverlet and two shams. Sizes vary based on whether you choose a twin, full/queen or king. It is made from 100 percent cotton material and is easy to keep in good shape. Add some spice to your bedroom's overall look and enjoy the comfort this collection provides.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ogU5-k+5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LaMont Home","source_asin":"B072KGZ8VK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072KGZ8VK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072KGZ8VK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
