window.products.push({"id":335922,"name":"MAISON ARTS Gold Counter Height 24 Inch Bar Stools Set of 4 for Kitchen Counter Modern Barstools Upholstered Faux Leather Square Stools Backless Farmh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bEJmwxv2L._AC_SL1398_.jpg","description":"【Water Resistant & Comfortable Golden Bar Stools】- The 4pcs barstools will be delivered in 2 boxes, the 2 boxes may arrive at different days. The 3.5\" thick soft padded cushion and build-in footrest of the barstools always provides people with more comfortable and relaxing sitting experience. Water resistant function make the bar stools quite easy to clean, which could be a distinctive furniture piece that balances with a variety of decor styles and add a touch of elegance to your home. 【Stain & Scratch Resistant Seat】- The backless seat of the counter height bar stools are made of stain and scratch-resistant PU leather with soft foam cushion. Quality anti-scratch PU leather keeps your seat protected. And also the stain & water-resistant feature made the barstool chair quite easy to care. Non-slipped foot pads of the kitchen stoolS protect the floor from being scratched. 【Gold Sturdy & Stylish Counter Stool】- Solid metal gold frame with built-in footrest makes the counter stools more sturdy, max loading capacity up to 330 pounds, and could be used for years without problem. Nicely stitched PU leather with gold steel base, the modern and minimalist design of the bar stool fits in with both contemporary and traditional decor. 【Ideal Space Saver Stools】 - The 4-Pieces barstools will delivered with 2 boxes, which may arrive at different days. Tuck & hide stool under counter, leg frame of the counter stool doesn't extend past the padded seat, so you can properly store these counter height stools. You can slide the stool right under the bar or counter in your apartment, loft, or college dorm room. 【Wide Application & Easy Assemble】 - 24 inch counter height barstools, suitable for 34-40 inches height tables. Easy to assemble, includes all necessary hardware and installation manual in the package. MAISON ARTS bar stool's industrial modern design and counter height is perfect for any dining table, kitchen counter, island, or home bar. Multi-functional use in home, restaurant, bar, pub, bistro, coffee bar, bedrooms, cafe, etc","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bEJmwxv2L._AC_SL1398_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAISON ARTS","source_asin":"B0C68MLD36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335922","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C68MLD36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C68MLD36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":335923,"name":"GLANRA Slim Tumbler 20oz with Lid, Coffee Travel Mug Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41o0yQm+QHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each of our Stainless Steel Tumbler is custom-hand-made of SUS 304 body and premium material lid. The only drink lid that uses the power of magnets to keep your water, beer, or favorite drink on lock. A durable coat of color won’t fade, peel, or crack through extended field use and also provide additional grip. The double-wall insulated tumbler with a vacuum between helps your drink to keep its temperature from 3 to 4 hours. Capacity: 20oz. Package: 1 x Stainless Steel Tumbler (without straw)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41o0yQm+QHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLANRA","source_asin":"B09WVKH772","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WVKH772","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WVKH772","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":335924,"name":"Toque Blanche Chamba Black Clay Deep Plate, Microwave Safe Plates, Classic Hand-Crafted Black Dinner Plates for Serving Dishes, 10.5 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yo5NT4YrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For generations, the village of La Chamba, nestled on the banks of the Magdalena River in Central Colombia, has been the heart of Chamba pottery. Today, the craft is so beloved that virtually every family in the village is dedicated to the making and selling of these unique and beautiful pieces. From rustic dishes that are perfect for everyday use to exquisite works of art that are destined for foreign markets, Chamba pottery is crafted with care and attention to detail. Each piece is lovingly made inside the homes of the families who specialize in this art, dried outside on porches, patios, and yards, and then fired in small ovens. The result is a stunning collection of pottery that showcases the rich history and culture of the region. And while each family may specialize in certain pieces, the craft of Chamba pottery is a community effort, with everyone pitching in to create these exquisite works of art. These pieces are now exported all over the world, bringing a piece of Colombian culture to homes around the globe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yo5NT4YrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toque Blanche","source_asin":"B0BGSTVMYV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGSTVMYV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGSTVMYV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
