window.products.push({"id":335949,"name":"Ruthy's Textile Queen Size Light Weight 4pc Printed Sheet Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YQRsAin0L._AC_SL1181_.jpg","description":"Experience luxury like you've never felt before. Sheets that feel almost hedonistic, this sumptuous set is going to bring your dreams to a whole new level. Slip between the covers and let yourself wallow in the decadence that this bedding offers. Add in delightfully soft, ultra-plush pillowcases, and you'll truly feel pampered. This 4-piece set is crafted from incredible, wrinkle-free 75 GSM and features an elegant dobby stripe pattern. It's available in a variety of beautiful colors, and no matter which one you choose, when morning comes and the alarm clock goes off, you just might be tempted to crawl farther beneath these covers and try to pick up where your dreams left off. Care Instructions: Machine wash Cold, Gentle Cycle. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low. Iron as needed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YQRsAin0L._AC_SL1181_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ruthy's Textile","source_asin":"B010BZ2LVE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010BZ2LVE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010BZ2LVE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":335950,"name":"Double Wall Beer Glasses - Great For Coffee, wine , beer, whiskey, Or Any Hot Or Cold Drinks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513X-DLxkuL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Main Features of Double Wall GlassesMade using borosilicate glass Ordinary glasses contain a mix of quartz, sodium carbonate and calcium carbonate, while borosilicate adds boron to the composition.It helps to strengthen the glass and make it extremely lightweight, also rendering it heat-resistant - with quality better than traditional glass.It is blown by sophisticated techniques that are responsible for its toughness.Sturdy and robust structure This type of glassware is resistant to scratches, chips, and nicks with a lower percentage of breakage than single wall glasses due to the powerful borosilicate glass utilized during manufacture.These glasses are dishwasher safe, and since their thermal resistance capacity is quite high, they are unaffected by microwave heat as well.You could also store them in the freezer safely, without cracking or breaking.Great stability The glasses have superior stability so they can be used for both hot and cold beverages -from a fancy frozen dessert to hot coffee.The insulation is excellent, so it retains both hot and cold temperatures for a very long time.Moreover, the glass doesn't get cloudy or murky with time, unlike its conventional counterparts. Everyday use These glasses look exquisite and fancy, but can be used on a daily basis.The insulation properties ensures that heat or cold can't penetrate through the walls, so you won't feel the temperature against your palm which is a great added benefit for kids.Perfect Gift The next time you wrack your brains trying to come up with a great present, just buy a set of double wall glasses - they will surely appreciate this practical gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513X-DLxkuL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Just easy","source_asin":"B01I4XI52E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335950","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I4XI52E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I4XI52E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
