window.products.push({"id":335955,"name":"SweetMemo Premium Collapsible Laundry Hamper with Comfortable Handles, Foldable Hemp Fabric Basket, Easy-to-Carry Portable Tote Bag for Dorm, Closet, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MwcDhjuzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications:  - Volume Capacity: 82L - Weight Capacity: 25Lbs - Stand-up Size: 15” (Dia)*28” (H)  - Folded Size: 15” (L)*13” (W)*2” (H)  Key Features:  ★ No \"LAUNDRY\" lettering to serve you in a various occasions ★ Made from double-layer hemp fabric to increase strength, durability and breathability ★ Reinforced extra-strength rivet & stitching to avoid damaging when heavily loaded ★ Anti-skid handles with cushions for comfortable carry ★ Lightweight yet sturdy for easy transporting to laundromat ★ Bottom with thick double PE board for stability ★ Standing on its own whether it is full or empty ★ Foldable design to fit in limited storage spaces when not in use As an expert in storage products, our core values are centered in product quality. We aim to provide practical and stylish household supplies for our customers and offer high-quality items at a reasonable cost.  The premium laundry bag is an easy solution to satisfy all your storage needs. It fits seamlessly into the laundry room, bathroom, bedroom, hotel, utility room, a kid’s room or student's dormitory. It can also be used as a nice storage bin or a decent tote bag. It is deal for organizing and reducing clutter.  Package Includes: - 1 x Laundry HamperWarm Tips: - Wipe clean with a damp cloth only; Do NOT use abrasive cleaner to clean the laundry bag to avoid damaging the PE coating; No machine washing!  - It is ideal for a couple or single to use. For bigger family size, you may need more than 1. - To help the laundry bag stand up on its own even when empty, fill it to full capacity and then wait for 24 hours.  - If it has some smell since new, please allow the laundry bag to air out and the smell should disappear.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MwcDhjuzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SweetMemo","source_asin":"B0855K6YZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0855K6YZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0855K6YZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
