window.products.push({"id":335957,"name":"COZZIE Smart Mirror,48x30 Inch Bathroom Mirror with Lights,3000-6000k Dimmable 3-Color Anti-Fog CRI 90+ LED Vanity Mirror(White/Natural/Warm Lights)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":289.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RGmZx6-SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[3-DIFFERENT COLOR TEMPERTURE]:cozzie led bathroom mirror color temperature can switch from 3000k to 6000k white/natural/warm lights. You can change the color of the lights by click the button according to your needs. [DIMMABLE LED MIRROR]:cozzie LED mirror is dimmable, controlled with power switch. Simply touch the power switch button for 3 seconds to change light intensity from normal to brightest. [DE-FOG FUNCTION]:Our LED mirrors for bathroom feature with Anti-fog pad. The anti-fog function means no need to constantly treat your mirrors with fog free spray, or rinse them multiple times per shower. Waterproof box ensure safe lighting in wet bathroom environments. [EASY INSTALLATION]: Adopt hanging chip installation design. You only need to install the hanging piece on the wall to hang the mirror. Easy and quick to install. [HIGH QUALITY & LONG ENDURANCE] :Made from 5mm HD environmentally friendly copper-free silver mirror, no flicker, no UV. The modern classic exterior design makes your bathroom look more cool and luxurious. more than 50000 hours lifetime, perfect for bathroom, bedroom as makeup or lighting decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RGmZx6-SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COZZIE","source_asin":"B0BMQX8T17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-335957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMQX8T17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMQX8T17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
